(Severe Air Pollution & Wildfire Smoke Emergency Protocol) Tj T*

(Document ID: REF-EMG-2024) Tj T*
(Source: National Emergency Management Agency) Tj T*
(Topic: Emergency Protocols for Wildfire Smoke and Industrial Pollution Disasters) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Emergency Response Action Steps:) Tj T*
(1. Hazardous AQI \(AQI > 300\): Activate emergency clean air shelters.) Tj T*
(2. Clean Room Setup: Designate an interior room with zero windows or single sealed window; run continuous HEPA purifiers.) Tj T*
(3. Mask Mandate: Fit-tested N95, KN95, or elastomeric respirators required for any necessary brief outdoor transit.) Tj T*
(4. HVAC Isolation: Close fresh air intakes on building ventilation systems immediately.) Tj T*
(5. Health Triage: Seek emergency medical care immediately for severe shortness of breath, persistent chest pressure, or cyanosis.) Tj T*
ET
